.It Xo
.Fl s ,
.Fl "-syspath"
.Ar path
.Xc
Set
.Ql "*syspath*" ,
the root directory that
.Ql "lib/wattle" ,
.Ql "bin"
and
.Ql "share/man"
derive from,
to
.Ar path .
System modules are loaded from
.Ql "lib/wattle"
under it.
This replaces the value taken from
.Ev WATTLE_PATH .
.It Xo
.Fl v ,
.Fl "-version"
.Xc
Print the version of Wattle and exit.
.It Xo
.Fl h ,
.Fl "-help"
.Xc
Print a usage summary and exit.
Each subcommand also reads
.Fl h ,
and prints its own usage.
.El
