Manage the packages installed under
.Ql "*syspath*" .
Modules are installed in
.Ql "lib/wattle" ,
programs in
.Ql "bin"
and man pages in
.Ql "share/man"
under it.
A build made without the OS library does not include
.Ic pkg ,
and each verb exits with status 1 after saying so.
